		{"id":"node_0184","type":"text","text":"**GPU1：使用 T8 保存的 MB3 Stage1 Forward 激活，反传 LM Head + FinalNorm**\n累积本地参数梯度，并得到 dH4_MB3","x":1050,"y":5649,"width":570,"height":78,"color":"2"},
