		{"id":"node_0202","type":"text","text":"**GPU0：完成 MB3 Backward 并释放不再需要的激活**\n不执行 optimizer.step，继续梯度累积；Stage0 当前已累积：MB0 + MB1 + MB2 + MB3","x":320,"y":6516,"width":570,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node_0205","type":"text","text":"**GPU1 / Stage1：空闲（Bubble）**\n等待满足计算依赖，不进行该 Stage 的计算。","x":1050,"y":6220,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node_0214","type":"text","text":"## T10 之后：一次参数更新\n\n**GPU0 与 GPU1 已各自累积 MB0～MB3 的参数梯度贡献。**\n\n（若还有 DP，还需按策略同步梯度。）随后在各 Stage 本地调用 `optimizer.step()`；进行下一轮训练前再清理梯度。\n\n**跨时间步有两类箭头：**\n- **蓝色 / 紫色**：真实跨 GPU 数据依赖（`H2_MB*` / `dH2_MB*`）。\n- **橙色**：同一 GPU 的相邻时间步执行顺序（调度衔接，不代表张量传递）。\n\n**与 GPipe 的关键区别**：该排程在全部 Forward 完成前已经开始对部分 MB 执行 Backward。","x":320,"y":6802,"width":1300,"height":320,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node_0153","type":"text","text":"## T8 时间步\n\n**GPU0：B2**\n**GPU1：F3**","x":40,"y":5055.5,"width":230,"height":175,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node_0158","type":"text","text":"**GPU0：执行 Block1 Backward**\n得到 dH0_MB2，累积 Block1 参数梯度","x":320,"y":5080,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node_0179","type":"text","text":"## T9 时间步\n\n**GPU0：空闲**\n**GPU1：B3**","x":40,"y":5704.5,"width":230,"height":175,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node_0181","type":"text","text":"**GPU0 / Stage0：空闲（Bubble）**\n等待满足计算依赖，不进行该 Stage 的计算。","x":320,"y":5580,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node_0183","type":"text","text":"**GPU1 / Stage1：从 Loss_MB3 出发计算 dLogits_MB3**\n（按全局批次约定缩放梯度）","x":1050,"y":5580,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node_0188","type":"text","text":"**GPU1：Block3 Backward**\n得到 dH2_MB3，累积 Block3 参数梯度","x":1050,"y":5807,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node_0190","type":"text","text":"**GPU1：发送 dH2_MB3 至 GPU0 / Stage0**\n完成 MB3 在 Stage1 的 Backward；Stage1 当前已累积：MB0 + MB1 + MB2 + MB3","x":1050,"y":5876,"width":570,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node_0160","type":"text","text":"**GPU0：执行 Embedding Backward**\n累积 Embedding 参数梯度","x":320,"y":5149,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node_0162","type":"text","text":"**GPU0：完成 MB2 Backward 并释放不再需要的激活**\n不执行 optimizer.step，继续梯度累积；Stage0 当前已累积：MB0 + MB1 + MB2","x":320,"y":5218,"width":570,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node_0165","type":"text","text":"**GPU1 / Stage1：接收 GPU0 发送的 H2_MB3**","x":1050,"y":4922,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node_0166","type":"text","text":"**GPU1 / Stage1：H2_MB3 经 Transformer Block3，得到 H3_MB3**","x":1050,"y":4991,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node_0168","type":"text","text":"**GPU1 / Stage1：H3_MB3 经 Transformer Block4，得到 H4_MB3**","x":1050,"y":5060,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node_0170","type":"text","text":"**GPU1 / Stage1：H4_MB3 经 FinalNorm，得到 Norm_MB3**","x":1050,"y":5129,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node_0172","type":"text","text":"**GPU1 / Stage1：Norm_MB3 经 LM Head，得到 Logits_MB3**","x":1050,"y":5198,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node_0174","type":"text","text":"**GPU1 / Stage1：Logits_MB3 + Labels_MB3，计算 Loss_MB3**","x":1050,"y":5267,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node_0176","type":"text","text":"**GPU1：保留 MB3 反向所需激活与计算图**\n供 T9 的 MB3 Backward 使用，等待其反传。","x":1050,"y":5336,"width":570,"height":78,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node_0155","type":"text","text":"**GPU0 / Stage0：接收来自 GPU1 的 dH2_MB2**","x":320,"y":4922,"width":570,"height":58,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node_0156","type":"text","text":"**GPU0：使用 T5 保存的 MB2 Stage0 Forward 激活，执行 Block2 Backward**\n得到 dH1_MB2，累积 Block2 参数梯度","x":320,"y":4991,"width":570,"height":78,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node_0001","type":"text","text":"## 非交错 1F1B · 两 GPU / 四 Micro-Batches（调度连线增强版）\n\nStage0：Embedding → Block1 → Block2   |   Stage1：Block3 → Block4 → FinalNorm → LM Head → Loss\n\n**F = Forward（前向） · B = Backward（反向） · 空闲 = Bubble**\n\n一个 Stage 的一次 F 或 B 约占 1 个逻辑时间步；通信延迟暂不单独计时。\n\n**新增**：保留 T1～T10 的同 GPU 调度衔接箭头；数据传递箭头独立标记。","x":20,"y":-80,"width":1690,"height":185,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node_0216","type":"group","x":1760,"y":40,"width":940,"height":570,"color":"6","label":"连线图例 · 三类关系"},
		{"id":"node_0217","type":"text","text":"## 本版修订重点\n\n1. 保留原版详细计算节点、Backward 激活来源与阶段性梯度累积。\n2. 补上 **18 条同 GPU 相邻时间步调度箭头**（GPU0 / GPU1 各 9 条）。\n3. 保留并标注 **8 条跨 Stage 数据传递箭头**，避免把“调度”误读为“张量输入”。","x":1780,"y":85,"width":900,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node_0218","type":"text","text":"**蓝色箭头：前向数据依赖**\n`H2_MB*`：GPU0 / Stage0 → GPU1 / Stage1。","x":1780,"y":265,"width":420,"height":95,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node_0219","type":"text","text":"**紫色箭头：反向数据依赖**\n`dH2_MB*`：GPU1 / Stage1 → GPU0 / Stage0。","x":2240,"y":265,"width":420,"height":95,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node_0220","type":"text","text":"**阅读方式**\n橙色箭头顺着同一 GPU 的 T1→T10 任务往下连接，表示“下一项调度”，不是当前节点输出给下一节点的张量。\n灰色箭头连接同一时间步内的计算步骤；其余蓝/紫箭头表示跨 GPU 传值。","x":1780,"y":465,"width":880,"height":105,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node_0221","type":"text","x":1780,"y":385,"width":880,"height":70,"text":"**橙色箭头：同设备调度顺序**\nGPU0 与 GPU1 各自按 T1→T10 相邻任务衔接；这是时序先后关系，**不是数据依赖**。","color":"3"}
	],
